                        │                                                 │
                        ▼ (Static Assets / UI)                            ▼ (Dynamic API Traffic)
              [ Amazon S3 Bucket ]                          [ AWS Network Load Balancer (NLB) ]
            (React 19 Flow Dashboard)                         (L4 Ultra-Low Latency, Cross-AZ)
                                                                          │
                                                                          ▼ Private VPC Ingress
